WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
Cardrove. A personal study space.
Your decks. Your pace.

00:03.600 --> 00:10.400
Import Anki .apkg decks.
Keep your subjects together in your library.

00:10.400 --> 00:13.000
Pause. Try to recall before revealing the answer.

00:13.000 --> 00:19.000
Reveal, then rate Again, Hard, Good, or Easy.
Space or Enter reveals. Keys 1–4 rate.

00:19.000 --> 00:27.000
Phone or computer. Light or dark.
Connected devices share your collection. Cloud study requires a connection.

00:27.000 --> 00:35.200
Name your workspace and choose your daily pace.
Manage your access code and study progress.

00:35.200 --> 00:40.000
Cardrove. Open source. Self-hosted.
Build your study space.
